# SHA-256 of the standalone patched gitleaks binaries (issue #55), one per OS and architecture.
# Built by `bash tests/gitleaks_assets.sh build` from Dockerfile.cpu's gitleaks stage: the pinned
# gitleaks commit, patched Go modules, pinned Go image. The build is reproducible; the Publish
# workflow fails if its binaries do not hash to these values. claude-plugin-guards carries a copy
# (guards/vendor/secret-guard-core/gitleaks-assets.sha256) that its self-heal script checks a
# download against, and a CI check keeps the copy equal to this file.
# Change the recipe, the Go image, a module version or the gitleaks commit: regenerate this file in
# the same change (build, then copy gitleaks-patched_<ver>_binary-sha256.txt over the lines below).
